{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122232048271-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122232536\"/><p>今晚(22日)8時19分，深水埗鴨寮街一單位有市民報案，指其姓劉(38歲)男友人在上址暈倒。警員接報到場，發現劉男倒臥客廳，現場被證實死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:03:56.335862+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T15:20:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T15:57:17.955507+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T15:57:17.955507+00:00","content_hash":"345712600c441a5372822fecd2f3a91213cb4bf4d1177bdfa1a2c2b22bfab993","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}